; The component-registry Feature's built-in base layer: rank 0, the id component-registry, at /,
; below every layer of the layer list and always present when one is resolved. It ships the two
; utility skills. A higher layer adapts them like any skill (body:text stacks, @replace replaces).
[skills/registry-refresh]
body:text = @file registry-refresh/SKILL.md

[skills/registry-explain]
body:text = @file registry-explain/SKILL.md
